# ── OSINTNEWS runtime files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything the app writes at runtime is disposable and may contain sensitive
# intel / personal search targets / API keys. Ignore the whole of data/ and
# reports/ and keep only the .gitkeep placeholders so a fresh clone still works.
#   - reports/*.html|.json|.csv|.md   generated reports
#   - data/settings.json              user settings (API keys)
#   - data/.deps_ok                   auto-installer sentinel (regenerated)
#   - data/history.json               GUI search history
#   - data/osint_history.json         CLI search history
#   - data/audit.log                  search audit log
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep

data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# ── Secrets / credentials (never commit these) ───────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env
# the template carries no secrets — keep it tracked
!.env.example
secrets.json
credentials.json
config.local.*
api_keys.*

